        "node_id": "n_7_2ca34b",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2: Iterate through the sorted list and keep adding items to the offer set until adding another item would violate the condition. However, instead of breaking immediately upon finding an invalid pair, continue checking subsequent items to see if they can be added without forming a valid pair with any previously added item. This ensures that we maximize the number of items in the offer set while avoiding any valid pairs.",
